// 900,000 >= 3 x 250,000, so it is a parachute payment; excess over the allocated base amount = 650,000. Total remuneration 1,200,000 less the excess parachute 650,000 = 550,000, not over the threshold. Tax = 21% x 650,000 = 136,500.
test "S4960-04-EXCESS-PARACHUTE-PAYMENT-TAXED-AT-SECTION-11-RATE" {
    given {
        context { decision_time @2025-06-01T09:00:00-04:00; knowledge_time @2025-06-01T09:00:00-04:00; legal_time @2025-06-01; timezone "America/New_York"; deadline_policy us.irc.core::IRC_CALENDAR_STEP; }
